              <p>Hello fellow hams,</p>

              <p>
                The August fox hunt is tomorrow at
                <strong>Marymoor Park</strong>! Here are the final
                details.
              </p>

              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                Logistics
              </h3>
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                     border="0"
                     style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="140"
                      style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Meet time:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>Noon</strong> near Marymoor Village
                    Station / Velodrome area
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Address:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    6046 W Lake Sammamish Pkwy NE,
                    Redmond, WA&nbsp;98052
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Parking:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    Paid parking may apply. <strong>Arrive
                    early</strong> &mdash; concert traffic
                    increases by early afternoon.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Frequency:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>147.42&nbsp;MHz simplex</strong>
                    (callsign K7LED); net control on K7LED repeater
                    (alt 146.580&nbsp;MHz FM simplex)
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Wrap-up:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>2:30&nbsp;PM hard stop</strong>
                    &mdash; debrief at the picnic area, then
                    clear out before the concert crowds arrive
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                Last-Minute Reminders
              </h3>
              <ul style="margin:8px 0;padding-left:20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Program your HT to
                  <strong>147.42&nbsp;MHz simplex</strong>
                  tonight
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Check the weather; bring sun protection for
                  the open meadow sections
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Bring water and a snack; the hunt runs
                  until 2:30
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Transit option: Sound Transit 2 Line to
                  Marymoor Village Station
                </li>
              </ul>

              <p>
                No experience needed &mdash; show up at noon
                and we will get you going. Loaner gear available.
              </p>

              <p>
                Questions? Contact
                <strong>Tom Sayles, KE4HET</strong> at
                <a href="mailto:TSayles@Soot-n-Smoke.com">TSayles@Soot-n-Smoke.com</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Participation is open (no registration required). Check
                in with net control when you begin hunting.
              </p>

              <p>
                See you at Marymoor tomorrow! 73 de KE4HET
              </p>

